# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Never add a line that matches /.well-known/* (Apple needs a direct 200 there).
# Game links (LA21 / LA9b): every /e/<event id> shows the same fallback page, address unchanged (rewrite, status 200).
# The page lives outside /e/ and is named without ".html" because Pages does not rewrite to /e/index.html.
/e/*  /game-link  200
